# Proposals

This directory indexes design-in-progress for `<repo-name>`.

## Belongs Here

- proposed documentation structure changes
- alternative placements and naming options
- open design questions and tradeoffs

## Does Not Belong Here

- current canonical guidance: `../Architecture/`
- adopted decisions and rationale: `../Decisions/`
- migration rollout records: `../Migrations/`
- retired material: `../Archive/`

## Use

Use this subtree for work that is still under consideration.
Index each active proposal by title/link, owner, and review status. At acceptance,
record the rationale in `../Decisions/`; update current Architecture and Reference
with the implementation merge. Delete a settled proposal unless distinct
rationale, migration, or audit value warrants a non-current copy in `../Archive/`.
Remove its active index entry and repair inbound links in the same change.
